    "body": "I dunno what would be best here. Your explanation in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5591#issuecomment-636868044 made me remember that I already knew this. I vaguely recall us having a related discussion about this at some time when either I was adding a new link type myself, or I was reviewing an addition that somebody else had made. In spite of having already known it previously, I forgot it until it came up again in this discussion now. So I guess it’s hard for me to agree that I think it’s clear\r\n\r\nCertainly I don’t think it’s likely to be clear to a normal web developer reading the spec — at least not as clear as it could be.",
